('green-acres','Green Acres Glamping','Lea, Herefordshire','A low aerial pass across the glamping site in Lea, followed by views of the surrounding Herefordshire fields. The marker is placed in the village.',51.893,-2.499,'/skyline-explorer/media/green-acres.webp',NULL,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2LNXfJaJ--E',NULL,'https://www.greenacresglamping.com/our-location'),
