('brockworth','Brockworth and Coopers Edge','Brockworth, Gloucestershire','The opening flight of 2026 From Above follows the fields around Brockworth and Coopers Edge at sunset. The marker represents the village area.',51.844,-2.160,'/skyline-explorer/media/brockworth.webp',NULL,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=thIa5NoHoto&t=9s','https://soundcloud.com/ian-newitt/sets/beyond-the-skyline','https://historicengland.org.uk/listing/heritage-gateway/results/record/e69ad6e1-bf9b-47ba-a9e7-09ef69119b25/MGC4595'),
